oor retreat, as inviting in January as in July. Schools and transit are minutes away, the University of Alberta is a 15-minute commute, and Anthony Henday Drive is just 6 minutes from the door, and a heated garage. A family home. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$549,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,751 sq ft"],["Year built","1972"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Duggan"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6J2M1"],["MLS® number","E4513839"],["Listed","October 22, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Freezer, Garage door opener remote(s), Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.11m x 5.61m"],["Dining room","Main level","3.59m x 2.56m"],["Kitchen","Main level","5.02m x 3.14m"],["Family room","Main level","5.23m"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.57m x 3.88m"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.75m x 3.49m"],["Bedroom 3","Basement","3.69m x 3.20m"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","4.08m x 3.34m"],["Bonus Room","Basement","7.28m x 5.58m"],["Bedroom 5","Basement","3.61m x 2.71m"],["Office","Main level","2.71m x 3.52m"]],"courtesy":"Melissa Sabourin, Rimrock Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"duggan","area":"southwest-edmonton"}